    <label>Lahlit Consortium</label>
    <description>The Lahlit Consortium is the most brutal and power-hungry megacorporation in the galaxy operated by one of the cosmos' most tactless and animalistic sophont races. Once a small mining outfit whose singular global government formed at the same time as the first Lahlit-built interstellar craft, the Consortium quickly became a galactic superpower due to their constant warmongering and colonization efforts, as well as their own brand of earth-scorching industrialism that makes sure to siphon every ounce of profit out of the ashen husks of what were once planets before they were conquered.
A highly militarized, trade-focused empire built from the ruins of a feudal, global alliance of industrialist merchant-kingdoms, the Consortium is ultimately a war machine fueled by the billions of silver credits funneled into it by the entire galaxy, one hellbent on progress and domination. All will fuel the Lahlit machine in one way or another-whether they do so as a happy customer or a prisoner of war is irrelevant.</description>
